 ## Overview
-SpotlessSplats is a robust Gaussian Avatar Reconstruction method designed to improve reconstruction quality in casual captures by ignoring transient distractors [S1][S2, unofficial]. It enhances the standard Gaussian Splatting framework by detecting outliers in a richer, pre-trained feature space [S1][S2, unofficial]. Unlike sibling methods that may rely on simpler geometric priors or explicit occlusion handling, SpotlessSplats leverages deep feature consistency to distinguish between persistent geometry and transient noise [S1][S2, unofficial].
+SpotlessSplats is a robustness-enhancing method for Gaussian Avatar Reconstruction that improves reconstruction quality in casual captures by detecting and ignoring transient distractors [S1][S2, unofficial]. It achieves this by identifying outliers in a richer, pre-trained feature space, distinguishing them from the stable geometry of the avatar [S1][S2, unofficial]. Unlike SWAG, which uses unsupervised transient Gaussians to ignore occluders, SpotlessSplats operates in a higher-dimensional feature space to filter noise [S1][S2, unofficial].
 
